# Printed by modules/print-pdf.ts on every production build. Chrome stamps a
# creation time into each print, so tracking the résumé meant a 172 kB binary
# diff whenever anything was built. CI regenerates both on deploy. The module
# writes straight into .output, so these two only matter for stale local copies.
